        -:   14:/**
        -:   15: * @brief UMA / OMol calculator: vesin neighbor list + AOTI package.
        -:   16: *
        -:   17: * Loads an AOTInductor ``.pt2`` exported by ``scripts/export_uma_aoti.py``.
        -:   18: * Each force call builds a fairchem-convention edge list with vesin and
        -:   19: * runs the compiled graph. Charge and spin are per-call tensor inputs.
        -:   20: *
        -:   21: * The package was merged for one composition, charge, spin and task.
        -:   22: * Every force call checks the config and the input against the
        -:   23: * metadata embedded in the package and throws UmaContractError on a
        -:   24: * mismatch (see UmaContract).
        -:   25: */
