        -:   36:  /// One AOTI call per chunk of up to the package's batch_max
        -:   37:  /// same-composition systems (a NEB band). Band packages carry only
        -:   38:  /// the batched graph, so a lone system is padded to two.
        -:   39:  void forceBatchImpl(const ForceBatch &batch) const override;
